      {
        "id": "major-question-01",
        "label": "大問Ⅰ",
        "order": 1,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-01\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-01\"><h2>大問Ⅰ 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>1)</dt><dd>60，72，84</dd></div><div><dt>2)(a)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{1}{6}(n+3)(n+2)(n+1)\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>2)(b)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{1}{6}(n+1)n(n-1)\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>3)(a)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(1+t,\\sqrt{3}t)\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>3)(b)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P\\left(\\frac{23}{11},\\frac{12\\sqrt{3}}{11}\\right),\\;r=\\frac{2}{11}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>4)(a)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-4t^3+3t\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>4)(b)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\frac{4}{3}t^3+3t\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>4)(c)</dt><dd>最大値 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{4}{3}\\ (x=0)\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>，最小値 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\sqrt{3}\\ \\left(x=\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\\right)\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>1)　約数の個数から指数の形を決める</h3><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>最初の一手</strong><p>正の約数が12個になる素因数の指数は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"11\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"5,1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3,2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2,1,1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> のいずれかです。小さい素数を大きい指数へ割り当てます。</p></aside><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-47d9e9d206c2\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">約数の個数から指数の形を決める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"2^2\\cdot3\\cdot5=60,\\qquad2^3\\cdot3^2=72,\\qquad2^2\\cdot3\\cdot7=84\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">他の指数型の最小候補とも比較すると、小さい順の3個は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"60,72,84\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> です。</p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>2)(a)　重複組合せへ読み替える</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"n\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 個の同じものを4種類へ分けると考えます。4変数がすべて0以上なので重複組合せを使えます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-d22e330db39a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">重複組合せへ読み替える</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"{}_4H_n={}_{n+3}C_3=\\frac16(n+3)(n+2)(n+1)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>2)(b)　自然数条件を0以上へ戻す</h3><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>変換の理由</strong><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a,b\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は1以上です。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a&#39;=a-1,b&#39;=b-1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> と置けば、4変数がすべて0以上になります。</p></aside><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-085be66b0818\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">自然数条件を0以上へ戻す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"a&#39;+b&#39;+c+d=n-2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-085be66b0818\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">自然数条件を0以上へ戻す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"{}_4H_{n-2}={}_{n+1}C_3=\\frac16(n+1)n(n-1)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>3)(a)　中心Pを直線CB上に置く</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-2eccdcb54265\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">中心Pを直線CB上に置く</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"C=(1,0),\\quad\\overrightarrow{CP}=t\\overrightarrow{CB}=t(1,\\sqrt3)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-2eccdcb54265\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">中心Pを直線CB上に置く</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"P=C+t(B-C)=(1+t,\\sqrt3t)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"a1-three-circles\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/aichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics/figures/a1-three-circles.svg\" alt=\"原点中心・半径3の円O1と、C=(1,0)を中心とする半径2の円O2がA=(3,0)で内接。O3はP=(23/11,12√3/11)を中心とする半径2/11の円で、B=(2,√3)でO2に外接しO1に内接する。C、B、Pはこの順に一直線上に並ぶ。\" width=\"760\" height=\"640\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>3円の接触関係（同一縮尺。小円の半径は2/11）</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>3)(b)　内接・外接を中心間距離に直す</h3><p class=\"prose\">円O3はO1に内接し、O2に外接します。したがって中心間距離と半径の関係は次の2式です。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-d85adfd54839\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">内接・外接を中心間距離に直す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"OP+r=3,\\qquad CP-r=2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-d85adfd54839\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">内接・外接を中心間距離に直す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"OP+CP=5\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-d85adfd54839\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">内接・外接を中心間距離に直す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt{(1+t)^2+3t^2}+2t=5\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-d85adfd54839\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">内接・外接を中心間距離に直す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"t=\\frac{12}{11}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-d85adfd54839\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">内接・外接を中心間距離に直す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"P=\\left(\\frac{23}{11},\\frac{12\\sqrt3}{11}\\right)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-d85adfd54839\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">内接・外接を中心間距離に直す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"r=2t-2=\\frac2{11}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>4)(a)　角のずれを3倍角へ反映する</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-05fb25208bcd\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">角のずれを3倍角へ反映する</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x=\\alpha-\\frac\\pi3\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\cos3x=\\cos(3\\alpha-\\pi)=-\\cos3\\alpha\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-05fb25208bcd\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">角のずれを3倍角へ反映する</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\cos3x=-4t^3+3t\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>4)(b)　三角関数の合成でtへそろえる</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-ac14206a6daa\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">三角関数の合成でtへそろえる</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\cos x-\\sqrt3\\sin x=2\\cos\\left(x+\\frac\\pi3\\right)=2t\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-ac14206a6daa\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">三角関数の合成でtへそろえる</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"f(x)=\\frac13(-4t^3+3t)+2t=-\\frac43t^3+3t\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>4)(c)　置換後の定義域を先に確認する</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c835bec461af\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">置換後の定義域を先に確認する</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"0\\leqq x\\leqq\\pi\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\frac\\pi3\\leqq\\alpha\\leqq\\frac{4\\pi}3\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad-1\\leqq t\\leqq\\frac12\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c835bec461af\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">置換後の定義域を先に確認する</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"g(t)=-\\frac43t^3+3t,\\qquad g&#39;(t)=-4t^2+3\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">端点と <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"g&#39;(t)=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の候補を調べ、最後に <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t=\\cos\\alpha\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=\\alpha-\\pi/3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> へ戻します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c835bec461af\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">置換後の定義域を先に確認する</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\max f=\\frac43\\qquad(x=0)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c835bec461af\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">置換後の定義域を先に確認する</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\min f=-\\sqrt3\\qquad\\left(x=\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{5\\pi}6\\right)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-02",
        "label": "大問Ⅱ",
        "order": 2,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-02\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-02\"><h2>大問Ⅱ 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><p class=\"prose\">答えは、1) <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x_{n+1}=2x_n+3y_n,\\ y_{n+1}=x_n+2y_n\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、2) <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x_n^2-3y_n^2=1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、3) <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}k_n=1/\\sqrt3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> です。</p><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>1)　(2+√3)を1回掛ける</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9712350bb747\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2+√3)を1回掛ける</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"(2+\\sqrt3)^{n+1}=(2+\\sqrt3)(x_n+\\sqrt3y_n)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9712350bb747\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2+√3)を1回掛ける</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"=(2x_n+3y_n)+\\sqrt3(x_n+2y_n)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>係数比較</strong><p>有理数部分と <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の係数をそれぞれ比較します。</p></aside><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9712350bb747\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2+√3)を1回掛ける</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x_{n+1}=2x_n+3y_n,\\qquad y_{n+1}=x_n+2y_n\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>2)　二次式の不変量を作る</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-e7bea220dd26\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">二次式の不変量を作る</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x_{n+1}^2-3y_{n+1}^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-e7bea220dd26\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">二次式の不変量を作る</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"=(2x_n+3y_n)^2-3(x_n+2y_n)^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-e7bea220dd26\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">二次式の不変量を作る</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"=x_n^2-3y_n^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">この値はnによらず一定です。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x_1=2,y_1=1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を代入します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-e7bea220dd26\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">二次式の不変量を作る</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x_n^2-3y_n^2=x_1^2-3y_1^2=1\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>3)　まずxn/ynの極限を求める</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-e77256bb7e77\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">まずxn/ynの極限を求める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\left(\\frac{x_n}{y_n}\\right)^2=3+\\frac1{y_n^2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x_n,y_n&gt;0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> で <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y_n\\to\\infty\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> なので、正の平方根を取ります。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-e77256bb7e77\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">まずxn/ynの極限を求める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{x_n}{y_n}=\\sqrt3\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-e77256bb7e77\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">まずxn/ynの極限を求める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"k_n=\\frac{y_{n+1}-y_n}{x_{n+1}-x_n}=\\frac{x_n+y_n}{x_n+3y_n}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-e77256bb7e77\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">まずxn/ynの極限を求める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}k_n=\\frac{\\sqrt3+1}{\\sqrt3+3}=\\frac1{\\sqrt3}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-03",
        "label": "大問Ⅲ",
        "order": 3,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-03\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-03\"><h2>大問Ⅲ 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><p class=\"prose\">答えは、1) <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt{10}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、2) <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"H=(7/3,2/3,-5/3)\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、3) <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"Q=((7+\\sqrt{13})/3,(2-\\sqrt{13})/3,(-5-2\\sqrt{13})/3)\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> です。</p><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>1)　球面の式を平方完成する</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-3719c6c771f0\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">球面の式を平方完成する</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"(x-3)^2+y^2+(z+1)^2=10\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">中心は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P=(3,0,-1)\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、半径は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt{10}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> です。</p><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"a3-plane-foot\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/aichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics/figures/a3-plane-foot.svg\" alt=\"平面α上のA=(-1,0,1)、B=(0,1,1)、C=(0,-1,-1)と球の中心P=(3,0,-1)。垂線の足H=(7/3,2/3,-5/3)は三角形ABCの外側にある。PHは平面に垂直。実座標を平面内の直交基底へ射影した図。\" width=\"520\" height=\"280\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>中心Pから平面αへの垂線。Hは三角形ABCの外側</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>2)　平面上の点を2変数で表す</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-7a91eb514d39\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">平面上の点を2変数で表す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{AB}=(1,1,0),\\qquad\\overrightarrow{AC}=(1,-1,-2)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-7a91eb514d39\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">平面上の点を2変数で表す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{AH}=s\\overrightarrow{AB}+t\\overrightarrow{AC}=(s+t,s-t,-2t)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>垂直条件</strong><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"PH\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は平面αに垂直です。したがって平面内の独立な2方向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AB,AC\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> のどちらとも内積が0です。</p></aside><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-7a91eb514d39\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">平面上の点を2変数で表す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{PH}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}=0,\\qquad\\overrightarrow{PH}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-7a91eb514d39\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">平面上の点を2変数で表す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"s=2,\\qquad t=\\frac43\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-7a91eb514d39\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">平面上の点を2変数で表す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"H=\\left(\\frac73,\\frac23,-\\frac53\\right)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>3)　交円Kの中心と半径を決める</h3><p class=\"prose\">球面を平面で切った交円の中心は、球の中心から平面へ下ろした足Hです。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-766e0c9b3529\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">交円Kの中心と半径を決める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{PH}=-\\frac23(1,-1,1)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-766e0c9b3529\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">交円Kの中心と半径を決める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"r_K^2=10-|PH|^2=10-\\frac43=\\frac{26}3\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"a3-sphere-plane-circle\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/aichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics/figures/a3-sphere-plane-circle.svg\" alt=\"半径√10の球面Sを平面αで切った交円K。中心Pから平面への垂線の足HがKの中心で、PH=2/√3、交円の半径HQ=√(26/3)。PHとHQは垂直で、P、H、Qは直角三角形を作る。\" width=\"720\" height=\"515\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>交円Kの半径は、直角三角形PHQに三平方の定理を適用して求める</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>平面内の正規直交基底で円周を表す</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fda262083cea\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">平面内の正規直交基底で円周を表す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\mathbf e_1=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}(1,1,0)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fda262083cea\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">平面内の正規直交基底で円周を表す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\mathbf e_2=\\frac1{\\sqrt6}(1,-1,-2)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fda262083cea\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">平面内の正規直交基底で円周を表す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{HQ}=\\frac{\\sqrt{26}}{\\sqrt3}(\\mathbf e_1\\cos\\theta+\\mathbf e_2\\sin\\theta)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>距離の読み替え</strong><p>xy平面との距離は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"|z|\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> です。したがってQのz成分の絶対値を最大にします。</p></aside><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fda262083cea\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">平面内の正規直交基底で円周を表す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"|Q_z|=\\left|-\\frac53-\\frac{2\\sqrt{13}}3\\sin\\theta\\right|\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">係数と中心値の符号から <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sin\\theta=1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> のとき絶対値が最大です。このとき <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\cos\\theta=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> です。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fda262083cea\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">平面内の正規直交基底で円周を表す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"Q=H+\\frac{\\sqrt{26}}{\\sqrt3}\\mathbf e_2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fda262083cea\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">平面内の正規直交基底で円周を表す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"Q=\\left(\\frac{7+\\sqrt{13}}3,\\frac{2-\\sqrt{13}}3,\\frac{-5-2\\sqrt{13}}3\\right)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>別解　平面上の2変数からzの範囲を出す</h3><p class=\"prose\">原本は平面上の点を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{AQ}=l\\overrightarrow{AB}+m\\overrightarrow{AC}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> と表す別解も示しています。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0b003b0510a6\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">別解　平面上の2変数からzの範囲を出す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"Q=(l+m-1,l-m,-2m+1)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0b003b0510a6\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">別解　平面上の2変数からzの範囲を出す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"l^2+3m^2-4l-8m+5=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0b003b0510a6\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">別解　平面上の2変数からzの範囲を出す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"(l-2)^2+3\\left(m-\\frac43\\right)^2=\\frac{13}3\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">この楕円形の制約からmの最大値を取り、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"z=-2m+1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を最小にすれば主解法と同じ点Qを得ます。</p><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>答案の要点</strong><p>主解法では、交円Kの中心がHであること、平面α内の互いに垂直な単位ベクトル2本を選ぶこと、距離をz成分の絶対値へ読み替えることを明記します。</p></aside><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"a3-unit-circle-parameterization\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/aichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics/figures/a3-unit-circle-parameterization.svg\" alt=\"平面αを正面から見た局所座標。左は直交単位ベクトルe1、e2方向の単位円、右は中心H、半径rKの円K。同じ角θに対し、HQ=rK(e1 cosθ+e2 sinθ)。三次元のx軸・y軸ではなく平面内の2方向を示す。\" width=\"760\" height=\"450\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>平面α内の正規直交基底で見る：単位円をrK倍し、中心をHへ移す</figcaption></figure><p class=\"prose\">別解を使う場合は、球面の式へ代入して得た2変数の二次式を平方完成し、mの範囲からzの範囲を求める流れを省略しないことが大切です。</p></section></div></article>"
      }
    ]
  },
